    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25907" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-στᾰτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>disintegrating,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ti.Locr.
				100e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.952b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Corn.
					<u>ND</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>causing discord,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					53
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				101
			</span></i> H. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
			<i>separately,</i> of vowels, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερόν φαμεν τὸ γρηύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Adv.</u>
					150.7
				</span></i>
			; <i>in extension,</i>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαστατῶς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				2
			</span></i>.</div>
